     "Hi all, <div><br></div><div>I am trying to run one file in GGIR (reason: because when I ran it with the rest of the dataset it provided no data in part 2 (for steps) but data in part5). However, when running the single files I get the following error: </div><div><br></div><div>&quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px\">Error in length(peak_info) == 0 || length(peak_info) == sum(<a href=\"http://is.na\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://is.na&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489039777000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1IOAmAe39zJQCl7frPPcfC\">is.na</a>(peak_info)) : </span></div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">  &#39;length = 5&#39; in coercion to &#39;logical(1)&#39;</span><font color=\"#000000\">&quot;</font></span></span><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><font color=\"#000000\">Full code and output below: </font></span></span></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2\"><span role=\"document\"