     1,
     "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Hi James,</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">This error is actually produced by the verisense code and not by GGIR.</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">Verisense code is not actively maintained. I previously left some suggestions in their repository to update the code:</div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/9\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/9&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489039795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12wtxBwtRX4wTNJih7oBRS\">https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/9</a></div><div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><a rel=\"noreferrer nofollow noopener\" href=\"https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/8\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489039795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2xwsIooTXR04YAn_3T3vt0\">https://github.com/ShimmerEngineering/Verisense-Toolbox/issues/8</a></span><br></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\">\r\n    <div>\r\n        <div><div><br></div></div><div>Do either of these suggestions address your issue?</div><div><br></div><div>If not, I am happy to investigate your issues as a paid consultancy and as part of the process try to tidy up the use of Verisense algorithm, please send me a direct message if you are interested.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Vincent</div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(107,107,107)\">Dr. Vincent van Hees | Independent consultant | </span><a title=\"https://accelting.com/\" href=\"https://accelting.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://accelting.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489039795000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2loKkGWbw4jMvHr_S6d-k5\">https://accelting.com/</a><br></div><div><img alt=\"image\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/RpackageGGIR/attach/1b193f2aba129/image?part=0.1.1&amp;view=1\"><br></div>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n            <div>\r\n        \r\n            </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br></div><div></div>"
